# .vercelignore
#
# This repo is a monorepo: Next.js frontend at the root, Express backend
# in backend/. Vercel only needs to build the frontend — the backend runs
# on Render/Railway/Koyeb instead (see README.md "Deployment" section for
# why: it holds course data in memory, which doesn't survive Vercel's
# stateless serverless functions).

backend
